      "message": "If this is a \"primitive color blender,\" we shouldn\u0027t ever generate a `BlendModeBlock`. BlendModeBlock controls the blend equation for the final draw against the surface which is always the very last thing that happens in a paint. The primitive-color blend happens much earlier in the process, mixing the paint color with the primitive color.\n\n(A diagram--primitive color blend happens in the dotted oval, blend-mode happens at the bottom:\nhttps://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1vFlrDxBhAvygDeoyDlWLmOC6JQtp1wVlSXyq0LlUItA/edit?resourcekey\u003d0-VSsIdNzu-J4m5tJzbmKMrQ#slide\u003did.g10541deba55_0_255 )",
